Now it is the month of February.
Today is Wednesday.
I am in the lobby of the building.
My neighbour Asha comes there.
She is always very happy.
Asha sees me and smiles.
She says - "Hello Maya!"
"How are you?"
I say - "Hello Asha!"
"I am well."
Asha asks - "Do you have time on Saturday?"
I say - "Yes, on Saturday is my office holiday."
She says - "Shall we go out sometime?"
She says again - "We can drink coffee together."
I ask - "At what time?"
She says - "At eleven o'clock in the morning."
I drink tea every day.
But drinking coffee is also good.
I say - "Great!"
"I will certainly come."
Asha says - "Thank you!"
"We will meet on Saturday at eleven o'clock."
I am happy.
From there I go to my home.
